# NOTE: paper/_searchnet-jss-web.Rmd was ignored here until 2026-08-24. It is
# the ONLY source of docs/paper/index.html, which is served live on the GitHub
# Pages site, so ignoring it meant the published page was unregenerable if the
# file were ever lost. It is tracked now. Do not re-add it.

# testthat auto-generated problem artifacts
tests/testthat/_problems/

# Build artifacts from rendering paper/searchnet-jss.Rmd
# (.tex is regenerated by keep_tex: true; bench_raw.* is RSiena projname scratch
#  written by the benchmark-overhead chunk)
paper/searchnet-jss.tex
paper/bench_raw.*
paper/_local/

# --- internal working files: never in the package or a public snapshot (2026-08-21) ---
HANDOFF_*.md
JSS_SUBMISSION_PREP_*.md

# RSiena writes a report file per algorithm object. `projname` resolves against
# DIR_OUTPUT, which defaults to getwd(), so a test that does not pass
# `dir_output` leaves its report next to the test file. Ignore the litter so it
# can never be committed; the real fix is for tests to pass dir_output.
tests/testthat/*.txt
!tests/testthat/_*.txt
nul
nul.txt

